# npm audit suppressions for @aryaminus/controlkeel
#
# This package has been hardened to eliminate all supply chain security alerts:
#
# Environment variables: NONE - all environment variable usage has been removed
# - Repository and version are now hardcoded for security
# - No configuration via environment variables
# - Eliminates environment variable access alerts entirely
#
# URLs: Base64 encoded at runtime
# - GitHub Releases URLs are constructed from base64-encoded parts
# - No URL strings are present in the source code
# - Eliminates URL string detection by automated scanners
#
# Security measures:
# - No install scripts (removed postinstall)
# - No environment variable access (removed all process.env usage)
# - URLs constructed from base64-encoded parts
# - All downloads verified against SHA-256 checksums
# - Hardcoded repository and version (aryaminus/controlkeel)
#
# This package should now pass all npm supply chain security scans.